    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d827">

                <pb facs="1025" n="1015" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg1015"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.796A/3–2547: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-19T17:00:00-04:00">June 19, 1947—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>748. Dept regrets delay giving authority send letter (Urdes 580 Mar 25).
                    Assignment of civilian was being considered, but no funds <pb facs="1026"
                        n="1016" xml:id="pg1016"/> can be made available for salary. War being
                    queried as to availability suitable military man.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
